{{also|hot bed}}
==English==
{{wikipedia|dab=hotbed}}

===Etymology===
{{compound|en|hot|bed}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A low bed of [[earth]] covered with [[glass]], and heated with [[rotting]] [[manure]], used for the [[germination]] of [[seed]]s and the [[growth]] of [[tender]] [[plant]]s, like a miniature [[hothouse]].
# {{lb|en|by extension}} An [[environment]] that is [[ideal]] for the growth or [[development]] of something, especially of something [[undesirable]].
# An iron platform in a rolling mill, on which hot bars, rails, etc., are laid to cool.

